Context-extension data (SFT model lineage only)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The 2K extension trained on replay data plus long documents from
harims95/hobbylm-longctx-2p5b, built from:
- PG-19 (emozilla/pg19 mirror of deepmind/pg19): public-domain books.
- arXiv subset of togethercomputer/RedPajama-Data-1T: per-paper licenses.
- Wikipedia (wikimedia/wikipedia, 20231101.en): CC BY-SA 3.0 / GFDL.
- Stack v3 Python (HuggingFaceCode/stack-v3-train): ODC-By, with per-file
  source licenses.
- FineWeb-Edu (sample-10BT, length-filtered): ODC-By 1.0.
The 2K and 4K extensions also used retrieval-forcing data:
- HotpotQA (hotpotqa/hotpot_qa): CC BY-SA 4.0.
- Qasper (allenai/qasper): CC BY 4.0.
- Glaive function-calling rows (glaiveai/glaive-function-calling-v2): Apache License 2.0.
- Synthetic needle facts and the synthetic function-calling pilot corpus (HobbyLM authors).
See "Training-data licence notes" in the model card for open questions on these sources.

